# Images in the reader (phase 3): the placeholder while the pictures download (a slow network), then the thumbnails where
# they stand in the text; the keys' ring (Up / Down scroll and the image nearest the middle has the ring, Tab jumps, Enter
# opens); the full-screen view (Left / Right, the line that fades, Esc; a tap opens, a swipe goes on, a tap closes); the
# gallery article: a progressive JPEG and a PNG that show, and the pictures that fail each in its own way (a 20000 x 20000
# header, a web page served as a JPEG, a broken PNG, WebP; the 7th and 8th are not loaded); an article whose text has no
# picture shows the feed's own.
seed pin us-ars-technica
seed refresh
seed refresh_on_open off
seed hint seen
net slow 1500
wait 900
key enter
wait 400
key enter
wait 800
key down
key enter
wait 400
expect state page reader
expect state images DD
expect text "Downloading…"
shot 01-downloading
check downloading
wait 2600
expect state images RR
expect state decode_peak 1
shot 02-thumbnail
check thumbnail
net slow 0
# the keys: Down scrolls the text, the ring marks the image nearest the middle
key down
wait 200
expect state ring 1
expect state img_focus 0
shot 03-ring
key tab
wait 300
expect state img_focus 1
shot 04-tab-next
key enter
wait 800
expect state viewer 1
expect state viewer_hd 1
expect text "Esc or tap to close  ·  2 / 2"
shot 05-viewer
check viewer fullscreen
key left
wait 800
expect state viewer 0
expect state viewer_hd 1
expect text "Esc or tap to close  ·  1 / 2"
shot 06-viewer-first
wait 2800
shot 07-line-faded
key right
wait 600
expect state viewer 1
key esc
wait 300
expect state viewer -1
expect state viewer_hd 0
expect state page reader
# touch: a tap on a picture opens it, a swipe to the left shows the next one, a tap closes
key home
wait 200
tapimage 0
wait 800
expect state viewer 0
drag 0.8 0.5 0.2 0.5
wait 800
expect state viewer 1
tapat 0.5 0.5
wait 400
expect state viewer -1
expect state page reader
# the gallery: every way a picture can fail, and the six-per-article limit; a tap on a failed one says why
key right
wait 2500
expect state reader_idx 2
expect state images RRTUUSNN
shot 08-gallery-top
check gallery
key pgdn
wait 200
expect text "Too large to show"
tapimage 2
wait 300
expect state viewer -1
expect text "Too large to show"
shot 09-gallery-more
key pgdn
wait 200
shot 10-gallery-end
# the lead image: the feed's own picture under the title when the text has none
key esc
wait 400
key home
key enter
wait 2000
expect state reader_idx 0
expect state images R
shot 11-lead-image
